{"id":"unmo_glich","lemma":"unmöglich","pos":"adv","rank":604,"glosses":["impossibly","not…possibly, it is not possible for/that…"],"ipa":"/ʔʊn.ˈmøː.klɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/De-at-unm%C3%B6glich.ogg/De-at-unm%C3%B6glich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Nichts ist unmöglich!","en":"Nothing is impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755905","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Es war unmöglich.","en":"It was impossible.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Das wäre unmöglich.","en":"That'd be impossible.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Du bist unmöglich!","en":"You're impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/87422","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Das ist einfach unmöglich.","en":"That's just impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759056","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"easy"},null]}]}